DXGK ETW manifest header, vendored so a standalone build resolves
<lddmcoreeventdefs.h> without a PIX checkout. It is placed on the include path
via EtwManifestPath (Directory.Build.props); an in-tree PIX build does not put
this directory on the include path and uses the real header instead.

  lddmcoreeventdefs.h
      The DXGK / LDDMCore provider GUID, keyword flags, and the event-id
      constants the dispatcher uses. These values come from the DXGK ETW manifest
      LDDMCore.man, which ships with GPUView (Windows Performance Toolkit). Only
      the values DxTimingCaptureLibrary references are included; if the dispatcher
      (include/DxTimingCaptureLibrary/EtwDispatcher.h) handles a new DXGK event, add its
      EventX_value here.
